<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were</p>
<p>steady to $0.50 higher. Demand moderate to light. Top $58.50 per</p>
<p>cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 lbs. 57.00-58.00, liberal volume 57.00-57.50,</p>
<p>few 56.50 and 58.50.</p>
<p>US 2-3   230-260 lbs. 56.00-57.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-500 lbs. 42.00-45.00, few 46.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs. 46.00-47.00, few 48.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs. 47.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
</text>
